om 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 142% of normal in June to July but only 41% in August to September. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 157% of normal and January to February at 45%.</p>"}
